<title>AUSTRIA: Austria opposed to any EMU delay - Schuessel.</title>
<headline>Austria opposed to any EMU delay - Schuessel.</headline>
<dateline>RUST, Austria 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria is opposed to any delay to the launch of Europe's planned single currency, Foreign Minister Wolfgang Schuessel said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;For us there is no question of a delay. A delay, or the failure of the project, would have an impact on job numbers, job security and economic growth forecasts,&quot; Schuessel told a news conference.</p>
<p>Austria's coalition parties were meeting in Rust, outside Vienna, to discuss the 1998 and 1999 budgets. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
